        "description": "Make use of convenient amenities, which include complimentary wireless internet access and a banquet hall.\n\nSatisfy your appetite for lunch or dinner at Bom-bahia Restaurante, a restaurant which specializes in international cuisine, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service.\n\nFeatured amenities include a business center, complimentary newspapers in the lobby, and dry cleaning/laundry services. Planning an event in Mumbai? This hotel has 2250 square feet (203 square meters) of space consisting of conference space and 3 meeting rooms. Free valet parking is available onsite.\n\nMake yourself at home in one of the 75 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and LCD televisions. Cable television is provided for your entertainment. Bathrooms have showers and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks.\n\nDistances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. <br /> <p>Worli Sea Face Promenade - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi <br /> Siddhi Vinayak Temple - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi <br /> Shree Siddhivinayak Ganapati Temple - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi <br /> Bandra-Worli Sea Link - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi <br /> Peninsula Corporate Tower - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi <br /> High Street Phoenix Mall - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi <br /> Palladium Mall - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi <br /> Tata Memorial Hospital - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi <br /> Nehru Planetarium - 3 km / 1.9 mi <br /> KEM Hospital - 3.4 km / 2.1 mi <br /> P.D. Hinduja Hospital & Medical Research Centre - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi <br /> The National Sports Club Of India - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi <br /> Shivaji Park - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi <br /> Mahalaxmi Racecourse - 4 km / 2.5 mi <br /> Mahim Beach - 4.5 km / 2.8 mi <br /> </p><p>The preferred airport for Hiltop Hotel is Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport (BOM) - 18.9 km / 11.7 mi </p>\n\nWith a stay at Hiltop Hotel in Mumbai (Worli), you'll be within a 5-minute drive of Siddhi Vinayak Temple and Haji Ali Dargah.  This hotel is 5.9 mi (9.4 km) from U.S. Consulate General and 7 mi (11.2 km) from Gateway of India.\n\nIn Mumbai (Worli)\n\nHindi, English\n\nVisa, Diners Club, Debit cards not accepted, Cash not accepted, American Express, Mastercard",
